 "comments": [
  {
   "id": "c1",
   "text": "Free for all, no buying. Everyone spawns with a knife and a deagle holding a single bullet.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 4
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2778,
    "h": 515
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c2",
   "text": "A deagle bullet always kills (the knife hurts as usual). Player About To Be Hurt can change the damage before it lands.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 977
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2278,
    "h": 243
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c3",
   "text": "A kill gives the killer one more bullet. The one who died loses a life, and comes back after 2 seconds if they have any left.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 1250
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 5278,
    "h": 801
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c4",
   "text": "After each death, count who is still in: lives left, and alive or about to come back (someone who joins mid-round waits for the next round). When only one is left, they win and a new round starts with three lives each.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 2522
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 3778,
    "h": 620
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c5",
   "text": "A round lasts 3 minutes, on the mode's own round clock (it shows on everyone's timer). Rounds end only here and at last one standing.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 561
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 778,
    "h": 180
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c6",
   "text": "Sudden death with a minute left: everyone glows red and gets one bullet, so nobody can wait it out in a corner.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 2120
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 3278,
    "h": 320
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c7",
   "text": "And every 10 seconds of sudden death each bot is told to hunt another player (Bots: Goal, Hunt it), so bots go looking instead of waiting.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 2041,
    "y": 3206
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 2778,
    "h": 306
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c8",
   "text": "Time up: the one with the most lives left wins (a life is worth 100 points, each kill 1, so kills break a tie).",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 3656
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 4778,
    "h": 682
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "c9",
   "text": "No bomb in this mode: on a bomb map the game hands one out each round, so at Round Started everyone loses it (Remove Weapon, the bomb). Bots then play the mode instead of the bomb, and a bomb can't end a round behind the mode's back.",
   "pos": {
    "x": 41,
    "y": 753
   },
   "size": {
    "w": 1278,
    "h": 202
   }
  }
 ]
}
